    'Take care when injecting the condition [[C0]] into a SQL query. Even if it appears to be harmless in the context you\'re injecting into, it\'s common for applications to use data from a single request in multiple different queries. If your condition reaches an [[C1]] or [[C2]] statement, for example, it can result in an accidental loss of data.' => 'Berhati-hatilah saat menyisipkan kondisi [[C0]] ke dalam kueri SQL. Meskipun terlihat aman di satu titik uji, satu nilai input dari permintaan yang sama kerap dipakai oleh beberapa kueri lain. Jika kondisi tersebut masuk ke perintah [[C1]] atau [[C2]], data bisa terubah atau terhapus secara tidak sengaja.',
    'Imagine an application that lets users log in with a username and password. If a user submits the username [[C0]] and the password [[C1]], the application checks the credentials by performing the following SQL query:' => 'Bayangkan aplikasi yang menyediakan login dengan username dan kata sandi. Jika pengguna memasukkan username [[C0]] dan kata sandi [[C1]], aplikasi memeriksa kredensial melalui kueri SQL berikut:',
