    'This causes the application to return all usernames and passwords along with the names and descriptions of products.' => 'Akibatnya, aplikasi akan menampilkan semua username dan kata sandi bersama daftar nama dan deskripsi produk.',
    'SQL injection UNION attacks' => 'Serangan UNION SQL injection',
    'Blind SQL injection vulnerabilities' => 'Kerentanan blind SQL injection',
    'Many instances of SQL injection are blind vulnerabilities. This means that the application does not return the results of the SQL query or the details of any database errors within its responses. Blind vulnerabilities can still be exploited to access unauthorized data, but the techniques involved are generally more complicated and difficult to perform.' => 'Banyak celah SQL injection bersifat blind, artinya aplikasi tidak mengembalikan hasil kueri SQL maupun detail pesan error database di respons HTTP. Celah ini tetap bisa dieksploitasi untuk mengakses data secara ilegal, meskipun tekniknya lebih kompleks.',
    'The following techniques can be used to exploit blind SQL injection vulnerabilities, depending on the nature of the vulnerability and the database involved:' => 'Teknik berikut dapat digunakan untuk mengeksploitasi blind SQL injection, bergantung pada karakteristik kerentanan dan jenis database:',
    'You can change the logic of the query to trigger a detectable difference in the application\'s response depending on the truth of a single condition. This might involve injecting a new condition into some Boolean logic, or conditionally triggering an error such as a divide-by-zero.' => 'Mengubah logika kueri agar memicu perbedaan respons aplikasi yang dapat diamati berdasarkan benar tidaknya suatu kondisi, misalnya menyisipkan logika boolean atau memicu error pembagian dengan nol secara bersyarat.',
    'You can conditionally trigger a time delay in the processing of the query. This enables you to infer the truth of the condition based on the time that the application takes to respond.' => 'Memicu jeda waktu eksekusi kueri secara bersyarat sehingga kebenaran kondisi dapat disimpulkan dari lamanya waktu respons.',
    'You can trigger an out-of-band network interaction, using OAST techniques. This technique is extremely powerful and works in situations where the other techniques do not. Often, you can directly exfiltrate data via the out-of-band channel. For example, you can place the data into a DNS lookup for a domain that you control.' => 'Memicu interaksi jaringan out-of-band memakai teknik OAST. Teknik ini tetap ampuh ketika metode lain gagal, dan data sering dapat dikirim langsung lewat kanal out-of-band, misalnya disisipkan ke permintaan lookup DNS menuju domain milik penguji.',
    'First-order SQL injection occurs when the application processes user input from an HTTP request and incorporates the input into a SQL query in an unsafe way.' => 'SQL injection tingkat pertama terjadi ketika aplikasi memproses input dari permintaan HTTP lalu langsung memasukkannya ke dalam kueri SQL secara tidak aman.',
    'Second-order SQL injection occurs when the application takes user input from an HTTP request and stores it for future use. This is usually done by placing the input into a database, but no vulnerability occurs at the point where the data is stored. Later, when handling a different HTTP request, the application retrieves the stored data and incorporates it into a SQL query in an unsafe way. For this reason, second-order SQL injection is also known as stored SQL injection.' => 'SQL injection tingkat kedua terjadi saat aplikasi menerima input dari permintaan HTTP lalu menyimpannya untuk dipakai kemudian, biasanya di database. Pada titik penyimpanan belum terjadi eksekusi berbahaya. Ketika menangani permintaan HTTP lain di waktu berikutnya, aplikasi mengambil data tersimpan itu lalu memasukkannya ke kueri SQL tanpa pengamanan. Karena pola tersebut, teknik ini juga disebut stored SQL injection.',
    'Second-order SQL injection often occurs in situations where developers are aware of SQL injection vulnerabilities, and so safely handle the initial placement of the input into the database. When the data is later processed, it is deemed to be safe, since it was previously placed into the database safely. At this point, the data is handled in an unsafe way, because the developer wrongly deems it to be trusted.' => 'Celah ini kerap muncul saat pengembang sudah mengamankan proses penyimpanan awal input ke database, namun menganggap data dari database pasti aman saat dibaca kembali. Karena dianggap tepercaya, data tersebut kemudian dirangkai langsung ke kueri SQL tanpa parameterisasi.',
    'Some core features of the SQL language are implemented in the same way across popular database platforms, and so many ways of detecting and exploiting SQL injection vulnerabilities work identically on different types of database.' => 'Beberapa fitur inti bahasa SQL bekerja seragam di berbagai platform database populer, sehingga banyak cara deteksi dan eksploitasi SQL injection berlaku sama.',
    'However, there are also many differences between common databases. These mean that some techniques for detecting and exploiting SQL injection work differently on different platforms. For example:' => 'Meskipun demikian, ada banyak perbedaan antar database yang membuat beberapa teknik deteksi maupun eksploitasi berbeda di tiap platform, misalnya pada:',
    'Syntax for string concatenation.' => 'Sintaks penggabungan string.',
