    'You can also identify what database tables exist, and the columns they contain. For example, on most databases you can execute the following query to list the tables:' => 'Anda juga dapat mendata tabel dan kolom yang tersedia. Pada mayoritas database, daftar tabel dapat dibaca dengan perintah berikut:',
    'Examining the database in SQL injection attacks' => 'Memeriksa database dalam serangan SQL injection',
    'SQL injection in different contexts' => 'SQL injection di berbagai konteks',
    'In the previous labs, you used the query string to inject your malicious SQL payload. However, you can perform SQL injection attacks using any controllable input that is processed as a SQL query by the application. For example, some websites take input in JSON or XML format and use this to query the database.' => 'Pada lab sebelumnya, Anda menyisipkan payload SQL melalui query string. Sebenarnya serangan SQL injection dapat dilakukan lewat input mana saja yang bisa dikendalikan pengguna dan diproses menjadi kueri SQL, misalnya input berformat JSON maupun XML.',
    'These different formats may provide different ways for you to [[A0]]obfuscate attacks[[/A0]] that are otherwise blocked due to WAFs and other defense mechanisms. Weak implementations often look for common SQL injection keywords within the request, so you may be able to bypass these filters by encoding or escaping characters in the prohibited keywords. For example, the following XML-based SQL injection uses an XML escape sequence to encode the [[C0]] character in [[C1]]:' => 'Format data yang beragam memberi opsi untuk [[A0]]menyamarkan serangan[[/A0]] ketika diblokir WAF atau mekanisme filter lain. Implementasi pertahanan yang lemah biasanya hanya mencari kata kunci SQL tertentu, sehingga filter dapat dilewati lewat encoding atau escape karakter pada kata kunci terlarang. Contoh berikut menggunakan escape XML untuk mengodekan huruf [[C0]] pada [[C1]]:',
    'This will be decoded server-side before being passed to the SQL interpreter.' => 'Nilai tersebut akan didekode di sisi server sebelum diteruskan ke interpreter SQL.',
